          "title": "LOGICAL \u2014 AND / OR / NOT / XOR",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **AND** \u2014 Semua kondisi harus terpenuhi\n\u2022 **OR** \u2014 Salah satu kondisi cukup\n\u2022 **NOT** \u2014 Membalikkan hasil kondisi\n\u2022 **XOR** \u2014 Hanya satu yang boleh terpenuhi",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eef2ff,#fff);border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">LOGICAL</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;color:#6366f1;\">AND / OR / NOT / XOR</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:7px;color:#16a34a;\">Amount > 10jt</div><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:7px;color:#16a34a;\">Country \u2260 ID</div><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">ALERT</div></div></div>"
          }
